<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drunk, for drinking,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί κακὸν ἐδανὸν ἢ ποτὸν
			πασαμένα</span> . .; <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1408
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					516
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.100
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτόν</span></b> ,
				τό, <i>that which one drinks,
			drink,</i> esp. of wine, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητῆρας ἐπεστέψαντο ποτοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.470
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖον ποτὸν ἐντὸς ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.341
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόμυον ποτῷ ὄψον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.630
				</span></i>
			; of wine, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				615
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				703
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ποτῷ χρησαμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ᾽; σῖτα καὶ ποτά</span> meat and
				<i>drink,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.3.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρωτοῖσι καὶ ποτοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτία καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					334a
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drinking water,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰὼ Σκαμάνδρου πάτριον π.</span>
			<i>water</i> of Sc.<i>drunk</i> by my sires, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1157
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σπερχειὸς ἄρδει πεδίον εὐμενεῖ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					487
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κρηναῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1461
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτάμια π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					659.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
